QuotesRequestBody.description:
The `POST /quotes` request. The required `kind` selects `pair` or `requote`;
missing or unknown tags are refused with `QUOTE_REQUEST_KIND_REQUIRED` or
`QUOTE_REQUEST_KIND_INVALID` before validating the selected payload.

items.description:
Credits of every pair read, oldest first by venue record time, then asset, network and
venue deposit id. Empty both for a read that found none and for pairs that were not read;
`unreachable` tells them apart.

holdings.description:
What TetraFi last observed held on the network, so a switch off can be confirmed first.
Answered only by a wallet's own networks read (`GET …/accounts/{accountId}/networks`);
absent on every other read.

apiVersion.description:
The API version this endpoint is pinned to (`YYYY-MM-DD`): every delivery body is
rendered in it and carries it as `apiVersion`. New endpoints pin the current version;
`PATCH` moves the pin.
